{"_v":3,"id":"cats-regional-2025","cat":"regional","cs":74.21,"rc":8,"bd":{"positive":6,"mixed":1,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Chris Jones","o":"Chicago Tribune","s":42,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.chicagotribune.com/2025/05/15/review-cats-paramount-theatre/","d":"2025-05-15","q":"But I found the piece too chilly, especially when you think this is a family attraction.","tc":1},{"cn":"Catey Sullivan","o":"Chicago Sun-Times","s":87,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://chicago.suntimes.com/theater/2025/05/11/cats-review-paramount-theatre-aurora-chicago","d":"2025-05-11","q":"It's a concept that elevates the show to thrilling effect."},{"cn":"Colin Douglas","o":"Chicago Theatre Review","s":94,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://www.chicagotheatrereview.com/2025/05/magical-and-majestic/","q":"It’s grandiose, groundbreaking and glorious."},{"cn":"Ed Tracy","o":"PicksInSix","s":91,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://www.conversationswithedtracy.com/picksinsix/2025/5/12/picksinsix-review-cats-paramount-theatre","d":"2025-05-12","q":"Die hard “Cats” fans, newbies and even skeptics like me will find this revival truly entertaining."},{"cn":"Barbara Vitello","o":"Daily Herald","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.dailyherald.com/20250514/theater/purrrrrfection-paramounts-cirque-inspired-cats-dazzles-the-eyes-and-ears/","d":"2025-05-14","q":"But the spectacle (in the best sense of the word) conjured by this top-notch team helps mitigate the show’s shortcomings."},{"cn":"Jacob Davis","o":"Around the Town Chicago","s":97,"b":"Rave","t":4,"u":"https://aroundthetownchicago.com/theatre-reviews/cats-7/","q":"I have seen over 17 productions of this musical phenom, and nothing has ever been this awesome!"},{"cn":"Allie Bugajski","o":"Allie and the After Party","s":88,"b":"Rave","t":4,"u":"https://www.allieandtheafterparty.com/reviews/paramount-theatre-cats-review","q":"It’s a fun and over the top show many will love."},{"cn":"Suzanne Magnuson","o":"Splash Magazines","s":66,"b":"Mixed","t":4,"u":"https://chicago.splashmags.com/index.php/2025/05/cats-soars-to-new-heights-at-the-paramount/","q":"And while it is extremely entertaining and full of astonishing talent, it completely and utterly lacks the heart and pathos that makes a good production of Cats really good."}],"hi":"/images/shows/cats-regional-2025/hero.webp?v=d496a1b3"}